# Point the app at the KilimoOrbit Sentinel server (it serves /api/soko/*).
# Leave it unset on a laptop: the app uses the computer Expo runs on, port 4517
# (localhost in the browser, 10.0.2.2 on the Android emulator). Set it for a
# deployed server, then restart Expo with `npx expo start -c`.
# Deployed backend:                 EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://your-sentinel.onrender.com
# A fixed laptop address:           EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://192.168.x.x:4517
#EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=
